rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Akka Edge feature summary</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://doc.akka.io/libraries/akka-edge/current/guide.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Akka Edge guide</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://doc.akka.io/libraries/akka-edge/current/lightweight-deployments.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Akka Edge lightweight deployments</a></li>\n</ul>", "templatePath": ""}